  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and I was once poor as a rat.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"But I was a servant once like you, for I was a slave in my house and I was beaten if I did not do the work of a slave. But now I am rich.\"",
